  "job_B3.3.12_20251003_114654": {
    "text": "Sancte Iohannes Baptista Spel.\nMEN \u00fea leofestan, her us mana\u00fe & mynega\u00fe on \u00feissum bocum & on \u00feissum halgum gewrite, be \u00feisse\nBe \u00feyssum we \u00feonne witon magon & ongyton he swi\u00fee us is \u00fees d\u00e6g to m\u00e6rsienne & to weor\u00feienne.\nFor\u00feon \u00fee we gehyrdon \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t halige godspel r\u00e6dd w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6niges Godes haligra gebyrd, ne his\nManige halge & gedefe witgan w\u00e6ran \u00e6r Sancte Iohanne, \u00fea w\u00e6ron myccle & forem\u00e6re, & fram Gode\n& hie w\u00e6ron gewitan ealra Godes degolra doma, & hie cyningum & yfelum ricum ealdormannum\n& hi heofon mid heora m\u00e6genum bridlodan, & hie on swi\u00fee manegum godcundum m\u00e6genum ealra\n& hie \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00fef\u00e6stnesse spellodan & tacen secgende w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00fee Drihten sylf getacnode.\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t hw\u00e6\u00feere be \u00feare n\u00e6nigum gecweden beon ne mihte, \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lende Drihten Crist be \u00feyssum\n& se godspellere sona on fruman his godspell swa be \u00fe\u00e6re Iohannes gebyrde wrat & cw\u00e6\u00fe, On\n& his wifes nama w\u00e6s Elizabe\u00fe seo w\u00e6s from Arones dohtrum \u00fe\u00e6s heahf\u00e6der.\n& se halga godspellere swa be him wrat, & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hie butu w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee gedefe beforan Gode, & hie\nEala hu swi\u00fee eadge w\u00e6ron \u00fea \u00e6\u00feelan cennende Sancte Iohannes, \u00fe\u00e6m ne sce\u00feede n\u00e6nig scyld \u00feisse\nAc hie w\u00e6ron gemyndige ealra Godes beboda, & on \u00e6lce wisan hie w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan \u00e6 swi\u00fee\n& nu seo heora iugo\u00fe & seo midfyrhtnes butan \u00e6ghwylcum leahtre gestanden, hwylc talge we \u00feonne\nSeo Elizabe\u00fe \u00feonne w\u00e6s unw\u00e6stmf\u00e6st \u00feara godcundra m\u00e6gena, & \u00feeah \u00fee heo \u00fe\u00e6s bearnes lata w\u00e6re;\nFor\u00feon \u00fee mycelre tide \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re halignesse hus gecl\u00e6nsod beon sceolde, & seo gastli\u00fenes \u00fe\u00e6s Cristes\n& seo heall \u00fe\u00e6s Halgan Gastes swylc templ eallinga Gode weor\u00fee funden w\u00e6s Haliges Gastes snytro\n& \u00fea \u00fee \u00e6ghwylc mennisc leahter on \u00fe\u00e6m eadigan Sancte Iohanne cennendum gestilled w\u00e6s, & hie on\n\u00dea w\u00e6s acynned se mon Sancte Iohannes, se w\u00e6s mara & selra eallum o\u00ferum mannum.\nHe w\u00e6s gelic Godes englum, & he w\u00e6s beme, Cristes fricca on \u00feysne middangeard, & w\u00e6s Godes\n& ic secge \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere w\u00e6s f\u00e6stnung \u00e6g\u00feer ge \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6, ge \u00fe\u00e6re niwan ge \u00feonne, for\u00feon\nFor\u00feon hie \u00fe\u00e6re an his gebyrde oforstag ealle \u00e6 \u00feisse menniscan gecynde.\nOnd nu seo Cristes gebyrd \u00e6t his \u00e6riste, se niwa eorendel Sanctus Iohannes; & nu nu se leoma \u00fe\u00e6re\nSylle se friccea his stefne.\n& for\u00feon \u00fee nu \u00fe\u00e6t is se dema Drihten Crist, seo beme Sanctus Iohannes, & nu mid God selfa on \u00feysne\n& for\u00feon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylces mennisces monnes gemet is \u00fe\u00e6t he Sanctus Iohannes lifes weor\u00feunga\n& he Drihten selfa swa on his godspelle be him cw\u00e6\u00fe, To hwon eodan ge to westenne, witgan to\nIc hine secge maran & selran \u00feonne \u00e6nigne witgan; For\u00feon \u00fee n\u00e6nig mennisc tunge ne geneah \u00fe\u00e6s\nEac spr\u00e6c se heahengel Sanctus Gabriel & cw\u00e6\u00fe to Zachariam his f\u00e6der, Ne wilt \u00feu \u00fee ondr\u00e6dan\n\u00dein ben is eallunga fram Gode gehyred, end \u00fein wif Elizabet \u00fee gebere\u00fe sunu, & \u00feu cegst his noman\nHe bi\u00fe eallinga swi\u00fee mycel beforan Gode; ne drinc\u00fe he win ne ealu, ac he bi\u00f0 gefylled mid Halgum\n& manige Israhela bearna he gehwyrf\u00fe to heora Drihtne; & he g\u00e6\u00fe beforan Gode mid Halgum Gaste\nUton we \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, gehyran hu swi\u00fee loflice Sanctus Iohannes w\u00e6s mid \u00fe\u00e6s Halgan\n& he \u00e6r to heofonum becom \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he eor\u00fean \u00e6thrine, & \u00fe\u00e6r Halgum Gaste onfeng \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he\n& he ongan lifgean ongean God, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he him sylfum lifgean mihte; swa Sanctus Paulus se apostol\nAnna \u00feonne \u00fey syxtan mon\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee Sanctus Iohannes on his modor bosm onfangen w\u00e6s, \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00fea heo \u00fea into \u00fe\u00e6re hire moddrian eode \u00fe\u00e6re halgan Elizabethe, sona \u00fe\u00e6t cild onsprang & ongean\nEala men \u00fea leofoston, hu \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s weallende spelboda & unge\u00feyldig heretoga, se \u00fee \u00e6r \u00feone H\u00e6lend\n& he \u00e6r to \u00feam cyninge becom & w\u00e6pn gegrap mid to campienne, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he to his lichoman\n& he \u00e6r \u00feone fe\u00fean sohte, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t leoht gesawe.\n& he swa on \u00fe\u00e6re his gebyrde oferswi\u00fede ealle \u00e6 \u00feisse menniscan gebyrde.\nUton we gesceawian \u00fea healican gewyrhto Sancte Iohannes se \u00fe\u00e6re modor inno\u00feas ongean \u00feam\n& \u00feeah he \u00fea get latode on \u00feissum lichomlicum gebyrde, hw\u00e6\u00fere he on \u00fe\u00e6m gaste anum \u00fe\u00e6s\n& sona swa he acenned w\u00e6s & geboren, he \u00feam f\u00e6der \u00fea stefne ageaf & \u00fea tungan onlysde, \u00fea se\nMycel is \u00feonne \u00feeos weor\u00feung \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Sancte Iohannes gebyrde, & eal rihtgelyfed folc sceal\nMycel is se haligdom & seo weor\u00feung Sancte Iohannes \u00fe\u00e6s mycelnesse se H\u00e6lend Drihten sylfa tacn\nSelfa se w\u00e6s butan menniscan f\u00e6der fram unwemre f\u00e6mnan acenned.\nSanctus Iohannes \u00feonne g\u00e6\u00fe beforan eallum o\u00ferum witgan, & ealra o\u00feerra heahf\u00e6dera m\u00e6gen he\n& eallum Godes halgum he is sigef\u00e6stra & gecorenra.\n& eall \u00feeos mennisce gebyrd Sancte Iohanne bedyrned is.\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon, \u00fea \u00fea Esaias se witga r\u00e6den w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t se Halga Gast swa \u00feurh hine be Sancte\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feonne swi\u00fee healic nama \u00fe\u00e6t Sanctus Iohannes engel w\u00e6s nemned; ac \u00fe\u00e6t his lif \u00fe\u00e6m his\nHwanne gefyrnode.\nBe wyrtum & be wudu hunige?\nO\u00fe\u00fee hw\u00e6r agylte he \u00e6fre on his gegerelan, se \u00fee mid \u00feon anum hr\u00e6gle w\u00e6s gegyrwed \u00fee of olfenda\nO\u00fe\u00fee hu mihte \u00e6fre \u00e6nig mara beon \u00fee \u00e6fre God on eallum his life lufode \u00feonne se \u00fee n\u00e6fre fram\nO\u00fe\u00fee hwanne besmat hine seo scyld \u00fe\u00e6re fealasprecolnesse, \u00feone \u00fee swa feor from eallum monnum\nO\u00fe\u00fee hu sce\u00feede him seo synn \u00fe\u00e6re swigunga \u00fee swa stronglice \u00fea Iudeas \u00fereade, \u00fee to him coman\n& he swa cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ge n\u00e6ddrena cynn, hwylc \u00e6teowde eow to fleonne fram \u00f0on toweardan Godes erre?\n& hine \u00f0a \u00fea heapas frugnon, hw\u00e6t hie wyrcean mihton \u00fe\u00e6t hie Godes erre beflugon, he hie \u00feonne\nWyrcea\u00f0 ac wesa\u00f0 \u00feancfulle \u00feon H\u00e6lende eoweres andleofan.\nUton we \u00f0onne \u00feus healices & \u00f0us forem\u00e6res ures mundboran lare folgian, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00f0one bylewitan\nSo\u00f0 ic eow secge, swa lange swa ge \u00f0is dydon \u00f0ara anum \u00f0e on me gelyfdon, \u00f0eah hit se l\u00e6sta w\u00e6re\nHw\u00e6t sceal ic \u00f0onne ma secgean fram Sancte Iohanne, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00f0e \u00feas boc worhte, buton \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6r\n& \u00f0\u00e6s f\u00e6der & \u00f0\u00e6re modor & \u00f0\u00e6s suna heortan se ilca Halga Gast mid his gifum gefylde, \u00f0\u00e6m is\nAmen.",
